So what dimensions we want to use for the text embeddings?

117
00:09:01,582 --> 00:09:03,200
We're going to use FastAPI.

118
00:09:03,360 --> 00:09:06,080
We want to use OpenAI library for embeddings.

119
00:09:06,320 --> 00:09:08,480
So again, we break this down into a number of tasks.

120
00:09:08,560 --> 00:09:11,360
So we start by adding the PG vector extension.

121
00:09:11,520 --> 00:09:14,000
This is just what you would do as a software engineer, right?

122
00:09:14,160 --> 00:09:25,280
You would take a design, a senior engineer or a tech lead would break the work down into a number of tasks, and you would do those tasks individually, step by step, and you would review the work along the way.

123
00:09:25,360 --> 00:09:27,172
And this is exactly what we're doing with agents.

124
00:09:27,662 --> 00:09:29,360
So let's take a look at this in action.

